  <Docs>
    <summary>Records GPU drawing work for a Graphite context and produces recordings that the context can play back.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <format type="text/markdown"><![CDATA[
## Remarks

Create a recorder from a context with <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext.CreateRecorder(System.Int64)>, draw into surfaces created against it, then call <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecorder.Snap> to capture the recorded work as an <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteRecording>. This type wraps a native Skia resource and implements <xref:System.IDisposable>. A recorder is not thread-safe.
]]></format>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
